    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32731" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπορ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>invent, contrive,</i>
			
